WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
If it's too hard to shower&nbsp;
today, grab the baby wipes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.467
It may not be the normal way to do&nbsp;it,

00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:08.820
but you deserve to be clean.

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:13.173
If it's too hard to cook dinner,

00:00:13.938 --> 00:00:16.474
get paper&nbsp;plates, heat up something frozen.

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:18.564
You’ll go back to cooking and 
washing another day,

00:00:18.564 --> 00:00:20.393
but the&nbsp;day is not today.

00:00:20.393 --> 00:00:23.651
And in the meantime, you deserve to eat.

00:00:23.651 --> 00:00:25.488
If you're too depressed to do your dishes,

00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:28.847
get a two-gallon Ziploc bag
and keep it in your bedroom.

00:00:28.847 --> 00:00:32.674
Because if you put a dirty plate into a&nbsp;
two-gallon Ziploc bag and seal it,

00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:34.511
it will keep the bugs away.

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:38.769
Because you deserve a sanitary&nbsp;environment

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:40.623
even if you can't get out of bed.

00:00:42.159 --> 00:00:45.555
I could share with you hundreds
of other&nbsp;genius solutions

00:00:45.555 --> 00:00:47.622
that people have come up with 
once they embraced the idea

00:00:47.622 --> 00:00:49.776
that care tasks&nbsp;are morally neutral.

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:54.893
In my experience, people will exhibit 
mind-blowing creativity

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:59.684
when they are only&nbsp;taught how to speak 
compassionately to themselves.

